WEBVTT

00:32.281 --> 00:36.911
THE PRACTICAL GUIDE TO LOVE

01:00.059 --> 01:01.060
Hold on.

01:03.312 --> 01:04.313
Well, here we are.

01:05.106 --> 01:07.024
I'll head in now. Get home safely.

01:07.900 --> 01:09.485
I still have something to tell you.

01:09.652 --> 01:11.070
Oh, what is it?

01:12.905 --> 01:14.865
You know how you told me
to stand for what I love?

01:15.533 --> 01:16.576
I like you.

01:19.745 --> 01:22.748
- Huh?
- I know I'm not that great right now.

01:23.249 --> 01:25.042
But I'm going to take acting seriously.

01:25.376 --> 01:28.421
I have an audition booked,
and I'll keep trying until I get hired.

01:31.716 --> 01:34.010
- Ji-su...
- I'll dress well around you

01:34.635 --> 01:36.887
so that I don't embarrass you.

01:37.138 --> 01:40.266
I'll also move to a nice place
where you can come visit.

01:41.225 --> 01:43.394
I can't take you
to a fancy restaurant often

01:43.603 --> 01:45.771
but I promise to take you to one

01:46.897 --> 01:47.898
for big celebrations.

01:50.776 --> 01:51.819
I want...

01:54.572 --> 01:55.823
to fall in love with you.

02:02.747 --> 02:04.081
Oh, I...

02:08.628 --> 02:09.754
Tae-seop.

02:14.925 --> 02:16.260
What do you think you're doing?

02:16.344 --> 02:18.679
Whatever I'm doing,
it's none of your business.

02:18.763 --> 02:19.764
Is it really not?

02:19.847 --> 02:22.433
You know Ui-yeong and I have feelings
for each other.

02:23.225 --> 02:24.644
As I told you at the hotel

02:24.852 --> 02:28.105
I don't like
seeing you hanging around her.

02:29.607 --> 02:31.692
Yeah, I remember that.

02:33.235 --> 02:34.695
But I like her, too.

02:35.404 --> 02:37.698
I'm not in a place to care
about how you feel

02:37.907 --> 02:39.408
or back down for you.

02:42.244 --> 02:44.330
Tae-seop...

02:45.915 --> 02:46.999
You three!

02:47.958 --> 02:49.669
Hello.

02:49.752 --> 02:51.796
What are you doing out so late?

02:51.879 --> 02:54.507
Your face looks pale, young lady.

02:54.590 --> 02:56.509
Are they bothering you?

02:56.592 --> 02:58.177
- No.
- Should I call the cops?

02:58.260 --> 02:59.512
It's nothing like that.

03:01.639 --> 03:03.265
I was just heading inside.

03:04.767 --> 03:05.810
Okay, goodnight.

03:07.853 --> 03:09.605
She can answer us separately.

03:11.273 --> 03:12.608
Sorry, Ui-yeong.

03:13.275 --> 03:14.652
You'd better head in.

03:14.735 --> 03:17.530
Goodnight, then.

03:17.988 --> 03:18.989
Bye.

03:23.035 --> 03:24.036
Ui-yeong!

03:24.912 --> 03:27.081
Think about what I said, okay?

03:44.807 --> 03:45.975
Aren't you leaving?

03:50.980 --> 03:53.899
THE PRACTICAL GUIDE TO LOVE
EPISODE 8

03:54.275 --> 03:55.651
I'm home.

03:55.735 --> 03:57.027
Hey.

03:57.570 --> 03:58.738
Did you just get off work?

03:59.071 --> 04:01.365
No, I met up with a friend after work.

04:02.116 --> 04:03.117
Who? Seung-jun?

04:03.409 --> 04:05.327
You seem exhausted.
Did you work out with him?

04:06.662 --> 04:09.790
You know what? I'm tired.
I'm going to bed. Goodnight.

04:10.374 --> 04:11.375
Sure.

04:22.303 --> 04:23.888
Who would possibly imagine

04:24.263 --> 04:26.682
blind dates would lead to such a mess?

04:51.874 --> 04:54.043
I should've asked her out sooner

04:54.835 --> 04:56.670
but I let some other guy beat me to it.

05:33.791 --> 05:37.002
I've never felt this way before.

05:40.005 --> 05:41.507
That wouldn't mean anything to her.

05:45.219 --> 05:46.512
I'm following my heart

05:47.513 --> 05:49.390
instead of my logic...

05:57.439 --> 06:01.235
Yeah, if I keep trying,
there will be a chance.

06:07.241 --> 06:10.202
You'll have much more fun with me
than with that guy.

06:32.349 --> 06:33.809
Gosh, what do I do?

06:58.500 --> 07:01.587
We're running out of the amenity supplies.

07:01.670 --> 07:03.422
We'll need to order some more.

07:03.505 --> 07:05.799
The Recycling Act came into effect
years ago

07:05.883 --> 07:07.801
and we're finally out
of single-use amenities.

07:07.927 --> 07:10.721
Other hotels went from single-use
to refillables in steps, right?

07:10.804 --> 07:13.265
Yeah, some have started selling
single-use amenities

07:13.349 --> 07:15.559
for anywhere from 1,000 to 2,000 won.

07:15.643 --> 07:19.355
Others are selling
eco-friendly or quality ones for higher.

07:19.438 --> 07:22.608
What do you think would be better,
Ms. Lee?

07:24.485 --> 07:25.486
Ms. Lee?

07:26.070 --> 07:27.112
Ms. Lee?

07:27.947 --> 07:29.990
Oh, what? Yeah.

07:30.824 --> 07:32.910
Oh, well

07:33.202 --> 07:35.412
it depends on whether we see amenities

07:35.496 --> 07:38.916
as a service or profitable goods.

07:38.999 --> 07:41.543
I think they should be considered
service products.

07:41.627 --> 07:43.170
You think so? Why?

07:43.253 --> 07:46.715
Our guests would feel inconvenienced
and dissatisfied without them

07:46.799 --> 07:48.592
leading them to think

07:48.676 --> 07:51.261
the quality of our hotel's service
has gone down.

07:51.929 --> 07:52.930
You're right.

07:53.889 --> 07:54.890
So, what should we do?

07:55.182 --> 07:56.558
Let's see. What should we do?

08:01.021 --> 08:02.439
You're really incredible.

08:02.982 --> 08:05.484
How can you zone out
and snap out of it just like that?

08:06.652 --> 08:07.695
Was it obvious?

08:09.196 --> 08:11.824
It's so easy to talk
about work-related things

08:12.199 --> 08:15.452
but why is it that the more I think,
the more confused I get about feelings?

08:16.662 --> 08:18.831
You need some fresh air? Or some coffee?

08:19.540 --> 08:20.791
Yeah, some coffee would...

08:21.750 --> 08:24.712
No, I'll pass on coffee today.

08:24.795 --> 08:27.089
You can go and get some.
I'll clean up here.

08:31.010 --> 08:32.720
Thank you.

08:33.095 --> 08:34.096
"Lee Ui-yeong"?

08:35.931 --> 08:38.934
Ui-yeong, this was delivered to you.

08:39.184 --> 08:41.770
Mr. Song ordered it for you.

08:42.312 --> 08:44.273
- I'll take one.
- Sure.

08:44.356 --> 08:48.027
When did you two become close enough
to get coffee for each other?

08:50.404 --> 08:53.240
Ui-yeong,
the air pollution level is high today.

08:53.323 --> 08:54.992
Going out wouldn't be a good idea.

08:55.075 --> 08:56.201
Have a great day!

08:56.285 --> 08:57.494
Look, Ui-yeong!

08:57.661 --> 08:58.787
Huh? Coffee?

08:58.871 --> 09:00.789
What? Why do you have so much coffee?

09:01.790 --> 09:03.917
Ji-su told me to bring these
to the whole team.

09:05.044 --> 09:06.253
And he said

09:06.879 --> 09:08.589
"You'd better not get coffee elsewhere.

09:08.672 --> 09:10.674
If you don't come see me,
I'll come see you."

09:10.966 --> 09:12.176
He told me to tell you that.

09:12.634 --> 09:14.803
What? That's odd.

09:14.887 --> 09:18.140
Why is everyone competing
to buy coffee for Ui-yeong?

09:18.682 --> 09:20.309
What's weird about that?

09:20.726 --> 09:21.935
It's just coffee.

09:22.394 --> 09:24.354
It's just a coincidence.

09:24.438 --> 09:25.689
It's great for us.

09:25.773 --> 09:28.358
It's like a coffee party!

09:28.442 --> 09:30.027
It's a party!

09:37.534 --> 09:39.912
I'd hoped
it'd be just a one-time coincidence...

09:40.204 --> 09:41.705
- Here for a meeting?
- Yeah.

09:41.789 --> 09:44.416
But that coffee incident was
the start of a long battle.

09:44.500 --> 09:45.793
Hey, your shirt is unbuttoned.

09:46.001 --> 09:47.211
I unbuttoned it for you.

09:48.337 --> 09:50.339
A man trying to change my mind.

09:51.715 --> 09:53.092
That's hot!

09:54.635 --> 09:55.636
Huh?

09:57.805 --> 09:59.223
Alright, I'm off!

09:59.932 --> 10:01.850
- Enjoy your date!
- Bye.

10:02.226 --> 10:03.268
Tae-seop.

10:03.560 --> 10:05.479
I thought I'd give you a lift home
on the way.

10:05.896 --> 10:06.939
Are you hungry?

10:07.356 --> 10:08.565
No, not yet.

10:08.649 --> 10:11.026
And a man determined to keep me.

10:12.152 --> 10:13.237
SONG TAE-SEOP

10:13.320 --> 10:14.530
Are you at work now?

10:14.613 --> 10:17.574
Seeing the blue sky this morning
made me so happy.

10:17.783 --> 10:20.327
I know you're busy,
but don't forget to look at the sky

10:20.410 --> 10:21.620
and have a good day!

10:23.163 --> 10:26.291
I feel like I just got to work,
but it's already lunchtime.

10:26.416 --> 10:28.210
Don't skip lunch just because you're busy.

10:28.293 --> 10:30.838
And eat slowly so you don't get heartburn.

10:31.213 --> 10:32.506
Have a good afternoon!

10:34.216 --> 10:39.138
HAVE A GOOD AFTERNOON!

10:40.347 --> 10:43.642
A man who's diligent,
even when it comes to flirting.

10:46.395 --> 10:47.896
UI-YEONG! WHAT ARE YOU DOING? YOU BUSY?

10:48.355 --> 10:51.024
You must've had lunch by now.
Don't you want some coffee?

10:51.275 --> 10:53.277
I'll make a latte for you, your favorite.

10:53.527 --> 10:54.528
Come for some coffee.

10:54.736 --> 10:57.739
And a man who just flirts with me
whenever and wherever.

11:07.040 --> 11:08.041
Your drink is ready.

11:52.711 --> 11:53.712
Ui-yeong!

11:56.006 --> 11:57.007
Hey!

12:13.857 --> 12:15.859
You came a long way for nothing.

12:16.151 --> 12:17.236
I feel bad for you.

12:17.694 --> 12:19.780
Efficiency doesn't matter
when I do what I love.

12:19.988 --> 12:22.783
And we'll have to see
if this was really for nothing.

12:23.992 --> 12:26.203
Sure, then. Go on.

12:34.086 --> 12:36.129
A mother-in-law who runs
your favorite restaurant

12:36.213 --> 12:37.881
or a celebrity mother-in-law?

12:37.965 --> 12:40.259
Cut it out.
"This or That" should be banned.

12:40.467 --> 12:43.011
I'm not even close
to leaning toward one over the other.

12:43.470 --> 12:45.847
This game just exhausts me.
Don't even start.

12:46.431 --> 12:48.809
I've never seen a player in such a dilemma

12:48.892 --> 12:50.936
with both options in her hands.

12:51.103 --> 12:53.230
I guess it takes talent to be a player.

12:53.438 --> 12:54.439
Playing men...

12:55.899 --> 12:58.694
It's so complicated and disrespectful.
Why do people do it?

13:00.362 --> 13:01.780
You tell me.

13:01.989 --> 13:04.241
How can we understand
the hearts of players

13:04.324 --> 13:06.368
when we're only ever being played?

13:08.245 --> 13:10.205
What do you mean by "we"?

13:11.707 --> 13:12.791
None of your business.

13:12.958 --> 13:16.253
Anyway, maybe it's better
that those guys are being played by you.

13:16.336 --> 13:19.298
I might be being played by someone
who has a flock of fish.

13:19.381 --> 13:21.049
You mean "school of fish," you idiot.

13:24.344 --> 13:25.679
My stomach hurts.

13:26.430 --> 13:28.849
Why do you eat spicy food
when you know it'll hurt?

13:33.312 --> 13:35.022
I miss Songi Spicy Chicken Feet so much.

13:35.314 --> 13:37.983
It was just spicy enough
to relieve my stress.

13:38.650 --> 13:40.902
It doesn't compare to this capsaicin mess.

13:41.611 --> 13:43.655
Hey, you don't think his mother

13:43.864 --> 13:45.991
no, the owner

13:46.325 --> 13:49.286
is waiting for us, disappointed
that we haven't gone recently, right?

13:49.369 --> 13:52.372
How can you be worrying
about your favorite spot somewhere else?

13:52.456 --> 13:54.499
You're too soft.

13:54.583 --> 13:57.711
That's why men keep throwing
new dilemmas at you daily.

13:57.836 --> 13:59.796
Man, you think so?

13:59.880 --> 14:01.882
Stop falling for those unimpressive tricks

14:02.382 --> 14:03.675
and choose the stronger one!

14:04.718 --> 14:06.470
- Who has bigger thighs?
- What?

14:06.553 --> 14:08.347
It doesn't seem like a big deal, but...

14:08.430 --> 14:11.725
You want me to measure their thighs?
Or make them wrestle to test it?

14:11.850 --> 14:13.393
If it comes down to it, yeah.

14:13.477 --> 14:16.521
I'm sure they'll gladly participate.
They want this to be over, too.

14:18.023 --> 14:19.941
And you have to get your head in the game.

14:21.735 --> 14:22.736
Fine.

14:26.740 --> 14:27.824
Let's get going.

14:28.033 --> 14:29.826
I have to head back to teach.

14:29.910 --> 14:31.203
Okay, let's go.

14:33.121 --> 14:35.624
Seung-jun! When do you get off work today?

14:35.707 --> 14:37.000
Can I go to the gym?

14:37.084 --> 14:38.960
I have to be in the area, anyway.

14:41.421 --> 14:42.422
Let's go!

14:47.302 --> 14:48.804
I was wondering where I saw her

14:49.971 --> 14:51.014
but I remembered

14:51.473 --> 14:53.141
that I met her on a dating app.

14:53.809 --> 14:56.103
She said she loved my sexy forearms.

15:03.485 --> 15:04.486
Seung-jun!

15:07.531 --> 15:09.116
Why didn't you text me first?

15:09.449 --> 15:10.492
I did.

15:10.867 --> 15:12.828
You were just too busy
to check your phone.

15:14.287 --> 15:17.249
Oh, yeah. I don't check my phone
while working.

15:17.958 --> 15:20.001
Which is why I'm here!

15:20.710 --> 15:24.131
I can work out while I wait, right?
You offer day passes?

15:24.756 --> 15:26.383
Yeah, I do.

15:26.675 --> 15:28.176
But the gym's full today.

15:28.510 --> 15:30.804
- You can wait at the cafe...
- Oh! Ms. Cooler!

15:30.887 --> 15:32.139
That's me!

15:32.222 --> 15:34.224
- Would you like a day pass?
- Yes, please.

15:34.307 --> 15:36.935
We'll give you a special discount
since you're special to us.

15:37.018 --> 15:38.186
Thank you!

15:40.897 --> 15:43.608
You should just register at our gym.
You'd brighten it up.

15:43.733 --> 15:44.818
- Should I?
- Hey

15:44.943 --> 15:46.653
who told you to get more business?

15:50.198 --> 15:51.199
What?

15:52.659 --> 15:55.704
I could use this as a blanket
when I go to bed.

15:55.787 --> 15:56.788
It's so big.

15:57.998 --> 15:59.958
You need to trap the heat to warm up.

16:01.126 --> 16:03.170
First, go on the elliptical
for 30 minutes.

16:04.254 --> 16:05.881
No, I'm here to lift weights.

16:05.964 --> 16:08.967
I walked 20 minutes here for cardio
so that I could get right to that.

16:09.468 --> 16:11.803
Are you an expert? No, I am!

16:14.139 --> 16:16.099
I really hate doing cardio, though.

16:17.142 --> 16:19.019
Come on. Go and get changed.

16:37.245 --> 16:38.788
Are you coming from the restaurant?

16:38.872 --> 16:41.291
Yeah, your mom babysat Sua.

16:41.458 --> 16:43.793
I would've gone with you
if I knew you'd be off so soon.

16:43.960 --> 16:47.506
Your mom seems curious
about how things are going

16:47.964 --> 16:49.299
with Ui-yeong.

16:49.382 --> 16:52.636
I went to see her, but I barely did.

16:52.928 --> 16:54.471
I only saw someone I didn't want to.

16:56.014 --> 16:57.390
- That barista?
- Yeah.

16:57.474 --> 16:58.517
Man!

16:59.142 --> 17:00.685
Sua, get your tools.

17:01.019 --> 17:02.354
Time to put him in his place.

17:03.980 --> 17:05.690
I got dragged into a mess.

17:05.774 --> 17:07.400
All I did was fall for someone.

17:07.484 --> 17:09.027
I wasn't in it for a fight.

17:11.238 --> 17:12.906
This will make you happier. Go!

17:13.615 --> 17:15.408
- Hmm?
- Whatever you do

17:15.492 --> 17:16.785
just be yourself.

17:23.792 --> 17:24.960
Be myself...

17:30.048 --> 17:31.925
I shouldn't have had that tteokbokki.

17:33.677 --> 17:35.053
- Mom.
- Yeah?

17:35.262 --> 17:37.264
Do we have meds for heartburn?

17:39.349 --> 17:41.017
Not if there's none there.

17:41.351 --> 17:42.602
Is it really bad?

17:42.686 --> 17:43.937
Yeah, it's pretty bad.

17:45.063 --> 17:46.231
There's nothing.

17:47.566 --> 17:49.192
I'm going to lay in bed for a bit.

17:51.528 --> 17:52.904
You sure you'll be okay?

17:52.988 --> 17:53.989
Yeah.

18:06.626 --> 18:09.087
Did you have dinner, Ui-yeong?

18:11.298 --> 18:13.341
Yeah, I ate out before coming home.

18:13.967 --> 18:17.095
I'm just in bed right now
because I have heartburn.

18:22.767 --> 18:23.977
Hey, Tae-seop.

18:24.060 --> 18:25.395
Can you talk?

18:25.645 --> 18:27.439
How does it hurt?

18:27.522 --> 18:29.649
Oh, it's nothing serious.

18:30.066 --> 18:33.153
My stomach's been upset lately,
and I had spicy food for dinner.

18:33.236 --> 18:34.696
Do you have meds?

18:35.196 --> 18:36.698
We ran out.

18:36.865 --> 18:40.118
But I'll be fine if I get some sleep.

18:41.161 --> 18:44.539
It's hard to sleep when you're in pain.
Hold on.

18:46.958 --> 18:49.002
Hello? Tae-seop?

18:50.879 --> 18:52.005
Did it just disconnect?

19:04.726 --> 19:05.769
Hey, Ui-yeong.

19:06.311 --> 19:07.312
Tae-seop.

19:08.271 --> 19:09.814
I got some chamomile tea for you.

19:09.898 --> 19:12.025
Oh, thanks.

19:12.942 --> 19:15.403
Did you come all the way to give me meds?

19:15.487 --> 19:16.946
Yeah.

19:17.989 --> 19:18.990
Thanks.

19:19.366 --> 19:20.408
It's nothing.

19:24.120 --> 19:25.497
The air's so fresh.

19:27.582 --> 19:29.751
It would've been perfect
if we had some ice cream.

19:30.960 --> 19:33.588
I do that pretty often with my mom
after taking out recycling.

19:34.923 --> 19:37.217
Is your stomach better?

19:38.009 --> 19:39.469
Oh, you're right.

19:40.345 --> 19:41.846
It's all thanks to you.

19:43.348 --> 19:45.392
Stomach pains come from stress.

19:45.475 --> 19:47.602
It seems like I caused the pain
and made it better.

19:47.977 --> 19:49.688
No, it's not like that.

19:50.689 --> 19:53.983
I know, but I couldn't stop
thinking about you, so here I am.

20:02.117 --> 20:03.118
I...

20:04.536 --> 20:05.912
like you.

20:08.957 --> 20:12.085
They say you have to make up your mind
by the third date.

20:12.961 --> 20:15.171
I wasn't sure if I could feel anything
in three dates

20:16.089 --> 20:17.090
but I did.

20:19.426 --> 20:20.468
But...

20:21.010 --> 20:22.721
I've been too anxious lately

20:22.971 --> 20:24.806
I forgot to be mindful of your feelings.

20:26.641 --> 20:29.561
I'm not sure if I deserve to be respected
right now.

20:30.186 --> 20:31.479
That'd be asking for a lot.

20:31.771 --> 20:33.815
It's okay. You just need to be more sure
of yourself.

20:36.025 --> 20:37.652
I'll wait for you.

20:38.236 --> 20:40.905
I'm really good at waiting
once I set my mind to it.

20:46.119 --> 20:48.413
Could you give me your hand?

20:55.795 --> 20:57.422
But don't hesitate to run to me

20:59.132 --> 21:00.759
once your mind's made up.

21:15.565 --> 21:17.525
And five.

21:17.609 --> 21:19.736
Breathe out as you pull.

21:19.819 --> 21:21.237
Six.

21:22.363 --> 21:24.949
Keep going. Seven.

21:26.075 --> 21:28.369
Give me a sec. Just keep going.

21:30.413 --> 21:32.040
Good work, Hyun-min.

21:32.540 --> 21:34.417
This time, you're going to cycle.

21:34.501 --> 21:36.628
I was on the elliptical until dusk!

21:36.711 --> 21:37.796
Let me do something else.

21:37.879 --> 21:40.757
You need to push yourself all the way
to maximize the gains.

21:40.924 --> 21:42.008
Here. Come on.

21:44.219 --> 21:45.220
You can do it.

21:47.847 --> 21:49.015
You're doing great.

21:49.307 --> 21:53.561
You have to carry me on your back
if I can't walk home, okay?

21:53.770 --> 21:54.854
Absolutely.

21:55.063 --> 21:57.524
Come on. Put your feet on the pedals.

21:58.399 --> 21:59.567
And push hard!

22:01.194 --> 22:02.403
Keep going!

22:10.370 --> 22:12.664
- Good work.
- Good work.

22:18.378 --> 22:20.672
- Bye.
- Great work today.

22:24.133 --> 22:26.636
Let's do five more in this position.

22:26.719 --> 22:28.304
Go slowly.

22:28.972 --> 22:29.973
Huh?

22:30.890 --> 22:33.518
Two, three

22:34.227 --> 22:36.855
four, five...

22:38.314 --> 22:40.817
Pull all the way.

22:41.442 --> 22:43.695
Right on. And 20!

22:43.778 --> 22:45.780
Alright, onto the next side.

22:46.531 --> 22:48.199
Keep your abs tucked.

22:49.033 --> 22:51.202
Breathe out as you pull with your muscles.

22:52.912 --> 22:54.038
Three...

22:56.916 --> 22:57.959
Four...

22:59.502 --> 23:01.296
- I love these shoes.
- The shoes!

23:01.754 --> 23:03.506
They fit perfectly. Where are you headed?

23:03.590 --> 23:04.591
This way!

23:13.600 --> 23:15.143
- Really?
- Yeah.

23:15.226 --> 23:17.061
No wonder you're so buff!

23:17.145 --> 23:18.229
You're too nice.

23:18.771 --> 23:21.065
- Do you have a personal trainer?
- No, I don't.

23:21.149 --> 23:23.359
- I see.
- I'm heading this way.

23:23.693 --> 23:24.694
Okay.

23:24.986 --> 23:26.738
- See you around.
- Bye!

23:32.243 --> 23:33.912
Where is she going?

23:56.726 --> 23:57.727
Soonmu Market?

23:58.311 --> 23:59.354
- Hello.
- Hi.

24:06.611 --> 24:09.072
What? Another one?

24:12.992 --> 24:14.661
What are they saying?

24:24.754 --> 24:26.089
Oh, gosh.

24:27.048 --> 24:28.216
What the heck?

24:32.804 --> 24:34.347
Hmm? Seung-jun?

24:34.430 --> 24:36.391
Have you been following me? Why?

24:37.934 --> 24:38.977
Well...

24:40.228 --> 24:42.313
I... Well...

24:45.400 --> 24:47.235
One of the guys at the gym told me

24:47.485 --> 24:49.737
he saw you on a dating app.

24:51.280 --> 24:52.740
Someone at your gym?

24:55.076 --> 24:56.119
So?

24:57.745 --> 25:00.498
I just saw you leaving the gym with him.

25:02.000 --> 25:04.669
I didn't meet him on a dating app.

25:04.752 --> 25:06.629
He definitely said it was an app.

25:08.798 --> 25:11.009
An app... Huh?

25:12.051 --> 25:13.511
It's Soonmu Market.

25:13.594 --> 25:15.596
He bought sneakers from me.

25:15.680 --> 25:17.098
He has small feet.

25:17.473 --> 25:21.644
I sell things I don't use
and buy things I need.

25:22.186 --> 25:24.731
So, the guy just now...

25:27.483 --> 25:28.526
Here!

25:29.402 --> 25:32.071
I got the book you tore.

25:32.155 --> 25:34.574
I wanted the whole set.

25:36.159 --> 25:37.660
My gosh!

25:39.203 --> 25:42.081
I was so scared,
thinking it was something else!

25:42.165 --> 25:44.375
- Hmm?
- I thought you were someone

25:44.625 --> 25:46.169
who used dating apps

25:46.252 --> 25:49.922
and just slept around with random guys.
I was so scared.

25:50.840 --> 25:52.884
I wasn't even sure
if I should keep texting you.

25:56.095 --> 25:59.891
I want a serious relationship.

26:02.143 --> 26:03.186
Oh...

26:09.150 --> 26:11.360
But yeah, I've used dating apps.

26:14.530 --> 26:15.531
Huh?

26:18.576 --> 26:20.745
Dating apps. I've used them.

26:22.455 --> 26:24.415
Does that change your impression of me?

26:35.885 --> 26:39.722
My stomach doesn't hurt anymore,
but I can't sleep.

26:55.530 --> 26:57.657
Dating apps. I've used them.

26:57.907 --> 26:59.575
Does that change your impression of me?

27:01.369 --> 27:03.788
My stomach hurts when I have cold food.

27:04.956 --> 27:06.457
But now that my heart feels cold

27:09.252 --> 27:10.795
my nose is tingling.

27:28.938 --> 27:30.314
Notebook and pen? Okay.

27:30.398 --> 27:32.316
I can make mistakes.

27:32.567 --> 27:35.069
But I will learn from them. Alright.

27:36.112 --> 27:37.905
But the most important thing is

27:38.281 --> 27:39.866
to ask questions when I'm confused.

27:39.949 --> 27:41.492
- Acting like I know it is...
- Hey.

27:43.244 --> 27:44.537
Good morning.

27:44.704 --> 27:46.664
Was that your affirmation
for the first day?

27:47.206 --> 27:48.207
Yeah.

27:48.749 --> 27:49.917
Add one more thing to it.

27:50.001 --> 27:52.461
Don't panic,
even if things don't go as expected.

27:53.504 --> 27:54.505
Okay.

27:54.589 --> 27:56.299
- Let's head in.
- Okay!

28:02.054 --> 28:05.391
Sae-byeok? Is she our new hire?

28:05.766 --> 28:07.185
What about the hotel?

28:07.602 --> 28:10.813
My internship at the hotel has ended.

28:13.983 --> 28:16.360
Did you hurt your arm?

28:16.819 --> 28:18.362
Oh, this?

28:18.821 --> 28:21.699
I panicked and slipped

28:21.782 --> 28:23.034
on a rainy and slippery day.

28:23.492 --> 28:25.203
Always be careful, through and through.

28:25.286 --> 28:26.329
Got it.

28:26.454 --> 28:28.206
What year were you born in?

28:28.414 --> 28:29.999
In 1999? Or 1998?

28:30.082 --> 28:31.250
I was born in 2000.

28:32.585 --> 28:35.296
- She's the youngest!
- It's your lucky day!

28:35.630 --> 28:37.715
- Ms. Sim.
- Oh, yes.

28:37.798 --> 28:40.635
- Can you come to sign your contract?
- Oh, sure.

28:40.760 --> 28:41.761
- Oh, no.
- Oh, gosh.

28:42.470 --> 28:43.596
I told you to be careful.

28:47.558 --> 28:48.893
Don't panic.

28:48.976 --> 28:50.144
Or be so surprised.

28:54.482 --> 28:56.192
You can come in and leave anytime

28:56.359 --> 28:59.737
but try to work and rest
when everyone's doing the same.

29:00.529 --> 29:02.615
It's a rough environment to work in

29:02.698 --> 29:05.493
so save your best clothes for the weekend.

29:05.576 --> 29:06.577
Yes, sir.

29:07.286 --> 29:09.372
You look great in hoodies.

29:09.455 --> 29:11.415
- Don't you hear that a lot?
- Thank you.

29:11.499 --> 29:13.125
- I've never been told that.
- I see.

29:13.209 --> 29:14.919
Alright! This is the woodworking room.

29:15.628 --> 29:18.047
You can get your training from Tae-seop
as you assist him.

29:18.130 --> 29:19.507
Let's have a welcome party soon.

29:19.590 --> 29:20.758
Bo-yoon! Jin-su!

29:20.841 --> 29:21.926
- Coming!
- Coming!

29:26.514 --> 29:27.682
Have a seat.

29:30.017 --> 29:31.602
- 1,300cm.
- Okay, 1,300cm.

29:32.478 --> 29:33.479
And 450cm.

29:33.562 --> 29:34.689
What are you guys doing?

29:34.772 --> 29:36.607
We're making a custom-made chair for you.

29:36.691 --> 29:37.817
It's a ritual at HOME.

29:37.900 --> 29:41.028
We're a woodworking studio.
We can't just sit on any chair.

29:41.696 --> 29:43.322
- Sae-byeok.
- Yes!

29:48.786 --> 29:50.079
You remember this tray table?

29:50.162 --> 29:51.706
Of course!

29:51.956 --> 29:53.791
You already finished it?

29:53.874 --> 29:57.378
Yeah, we'll check them today
and ship them to the hotel tomorrow.

29:57.962 --> 29:59.880
- Help us.
- Okay.

30:00.548 --> 30:01.757
This is your first task.

30:02.425 --> 30:03.509
Yeah, my first task!

30:06.929 --> 30:09.974
Where are you going after checking out?
Dr. Shin's?

30:10.099 --> 30:12.643
No, I'll go to Hannam-dong first.

30:13.686 --> 30:15.313
I just want to get some good rest.

30:15.396 --> 30:19.859
You know the agency's been through a lot
with the scandal, right?

30:20.776 --> 30:22.611
Yeah, I was just reading the scripts.

30:22.778 --> 30:24.280
Why did you send me so many?

30:24.363 --> 30:26.324
There were way more.
I picked a few good ones.

30:26.657 --> 30:30.369
You definitely proved yourself
as Korea's biggest queen of romance now.

30:31.370 --> 30:34.081
I think it's Ui-yeong.
Let me call you once I head home.

30:35.666 --> 30:36.667
Come in.

30:41.130 --> 30:43.507
You can just pack the necessities
and check out.

30:43.591 --> 30:45.968
The hotel van will deliver the rest
to your home.

30:47.219 --> 30:48.220
Thanks.

30:54.226 --> 30:55.227
It's Seasons of Us.

30:55.311 --> 30:56.520
SEASONS OF US

30:58.898 --> 31:00.816
Oh, that?

31:02.735 --> 31:03.944
You want it?

31:04.779 --> 31:06.697
Really? Are you sure I can have it?

31:07.156 --> 31:09.658
Yeah, you're my fan. Hold on.

31:14.205 --> 31:16.207
Thanks for all your help. I appreciate it.

31:16.540 --> 31:17.541
It was nothing.

31:22.588 --> 31:26.592
I HOPE YOUR BRIEF LIFE IS FILLED
WITH MANY DAYS OF LOVE

31:35.768 --> 31:37.520
Ui-yeong, what are you doing on Saturday?

31:37.603 --> 31:38.813
Let's get lunch or dinner.

31:46.904 --> 31:47.988
You can check your phone.

31:48.072 --> 31:49.407
Oh, okay.

31:50.574 --> 31:51.909
You still owe me.

31:52.159 --> 31:55.121
I may like you,
but that doesn't mean you're off the hook.

31:57.331 --> 31:59.500
Are you seeing someone?

32:00.000 --> 32:01.836
No, I'm not.

32:02.294 --> 32:05.089
Get on it, then.
Don't waste the good weather.

32:07.341 --> 32:08.426
The issue is

32:09.260 --> 32:11.470
I don't understand my own feelings.

32:12.388 --> 32:15.433
You must've been popular your whole life.

32:16.892 --> 32:18.269
Well, I can't deny that.

32:19.019 --> 32:20.896
You know how people say

32:21.814 --> 32:24.984
they feel sure about wanting to spend
the rest of their lives with someone?

32:25.067 --> 32:27.069
I don't know if I feel that way.

32:27.528 --> 32:28.529
There were...

32:29.488 --> 32:31.115
some moments when I just felt sure.

32:32.324 --> 32:36.829
Once you collect the many moments
of falling for someone

32:37.204 --> 32:40.040
you reach a certain threshold

32:40.791 --> 32:44.879
and at that point,
you just get so sad and hurt without them.

32:46.505 --> 32:47.798
That's when you realize

32:50.050 --> 32:51.177
that they're the one.

32:52.553 --> 32:53.637
Threshold...

32:54.847 --> 32:57.057
- Like an allergic reaction?
- Exactly.

32:57.475 --> 33:00.019
Isn't falling in love another form
of immune system failure?

33:02.521 --> 33:04.690
So, just spend more time with them.

33:04.773 --> 33:07.443
Look into their eyes
and talk to them more.

33:07.526 --> 33:10.946
Don't just think about it alone.
You'll have moments where you become sure

33:11.071 --> 33:12.698
when you spend more time together.

33:24.668 --> 33:25.669
Thank you.

33:28.005 --> 33:29.423
Thank you. It was really good.

33:30.341 --> 33:32.259
Thanks for the great stay.

33:32.593 --> 33:34.220
- See you again.
- See you.

33:44.522 --> 33:46.190
Sure, see you on Saturday.

33:46.482 --> 33:47.691
You can choose what to eat.

33:47.775 --> 33:48.817
Yes!

33:51.070 --> 33:52.363
Did something good happen?

33:53.030 --> 33:54.365
What's this for?

34:02.998 --> 34:04.542
Push them in all the way.

34:05.042 --> 34:06.168
We got this.

34:06.252 --> 34:07.711
Leave it to us. That's helping.

34:07.795 --> 34:08.963
- Wait.
- Hey.

34:09.046 --> 34:11.340
- Here, wear these gloves.
- Okay.

34:12.550 --> 34:13.551
Hey.

34:15.469 --> 34:16.595
You sure you're not going?

34:17.137 --> 34:20.099
This is a perfect chance to run into her!

34:20.182 --> 34:21.850
Just go with Sae-byeok.

34:22.226 --> 34:23.602
I did everything I could.

34:23.894 --> 34:26.272
What do you mean? Do more!

34:26.355 --> 34:28.065
What's got your spirit down like that?

34:28.357 --> 34:29.775
- Sae-byeok.
- Yes?

34:31.402 --> 34:32.987
Your first trip out. Good luck.

34:33.070 --> 34:34.738
- Everyone will be so surprised.
- Yeah.

34:36.532 --> 34:37.866
Let's go.

34:37.950 --> 34:39.034
Let's go now!

34:58.220 --> 35:00.556
- Hello.
- Hello!

35:00.889 --> 35:01.890
This way.

35:02.641 --> 35:05.352
I thought Mr. Song would come, not you.

35:05.436 --> 35:08.314
Oh, work's been busy.

35:08.856 --> 35:10.691
But... Ta-da!

35:12.276 --> 35:13.777
- Huh? Sae-byeok!
- Huh?

35:13.944 --> 35:16.071
Why are you coming out of that truck?

35:16.155 --> 35:18.073
I got hired at HOME.

35:18.157 --> 35:20.618
What? That's amazing!

35:20.826 --> 35:22.578
What a big surprise!

35:22.661 --> 35:25.539
I didn't expect this job offer, either.

35:25.623 --> 35:28.459
I was only fixated on what I was bad at

35:28.542 --> 35:31.128
but Mr. Song saw good things in me.

35:32.004 --> 35:33.672
Isn't he so thoughtful?

35:34.089 --> 35:37.384
Why didn't you tell us sooner?
It's good news!

35:37.593 --> 35:39.595
What a cheeky girl! Congrats!

35:39.678 --> 35:42.014
I wasn't trying to keep it a secret.

35:42.097 --> 35:44.183
I wanted to tell you at the farewell party

35:44.266 --> 35:45.601
but we kept rescheduling.

35:45.684 --> 35:47.311
You haven't had a farewell yet?

35:47.394 --> 35:49.229
No, not yet.

35:50.314 --> 35:51.690
Should we move the boxes first?

35:51.774 --> 35:53.108
Yeah, this way.

35:53.192 --> 35:55.027
Isn't this such great news?

35:55.110 --> 35:56.236
I'm so happy for her!

35:56.320 --> 35:58.364
- I can't believe she didn't tell us!
- Take one.

35:58.447 --> 35:59.698
WHISKEY BOXES IN THE GUEST SUITES
AT THE HILL SEOUL'S POP-UP

35:59.782 --> 36:00.783
- Bye!
- Bye!

36:00.866 --> 36:01.992
- Bye!
- See you!

36:02.076 --> 36:03.118
Bye, Sae-byeok!

36:07.748 --> 36:09.124
- Let's go.
- Yes, sir.

36:10.250 --> 36:11.460
- Sae-byeok.
- Yeah?

36:11.543 --> 36:12.961
About your farewell party.

36:13.045 --> 36:15.255
There's nothing to be sad about anymore.

36:16.048 --> 36:17.800
- No.
- Why don't we have a big party

36:17.883 --> 36:19.635
for the farewell and the welcome?

36:19.968 --> 36:21.553
It could be a job transfer party.

36:23.639 --> 36:25.933
- No?
- That sounds good.

36:26.016 --> 36:28.227
OFFER FOR PARTICIPATION
IN THE FINDING DAILY HARMONY EXHIBITION

36:28.310 --> 36:29.436
HELLO, THIS IS THE EXHIBITION TEAM
AT GALLERY RYE

36:29.520 --> 36:32.690
WE'D LIKE TO HAVE MR. SONG TAE-SEOP
PARTICIPATE IN THE EXHIBITION

36:34.525 --> 36:35.901
SEND AN EVENING MESSAGE

36:42.241 --> 36:46.286
ALARMS

36:51.291 --> 36:53.043
I'll do it all.

36:53.961 --> 36:55.921
Are you busy, Mr. Song?

36:56.004 --> 36:57.297
Why? Do you need help?

36:57.381 --> 36:59.466
Yeah, I need someone to help
with the sanding.

36:59.675 --> 37:02.636
Okay, I'll be right over.
I just need to write an e-mail.

37:02.720 --> 37:04.096
Okay, thank you.

37:18.694 --> 37:19.987
He's been so quiet.

37:31.498 --> 37:32.541
Hello?

37:33.041 --> 37:35.043
Is this Mr. Shin Ji-su?

37:35.252 --> 37:37.004
I'm calling about the acting audition.

37:37.463 --> 37:39.798
Yes, that's me.

37:42.468 --> 37:43.552
Oh, yes.

37:44.928 --> 37:46.013
I can do that.

38:01.904 --> 38:03.822
Once you collect the many moments

38:03.906 --> 38:06.533
of falling for someone

38:06.784 --> 38:09.661
you reach a certain threshold

38:10.370 --> 38:14.374
and at that point,
you just get so sad and hurt without them.

38:35.979 --> 38:38.273
HEARTBURN AND INDIGESTION MEDICINE

38:52.830 --> 38:54.790
- Ui-yeong, about the farewell party.
- Yeah?

38:54.873 --> 38:59.169
Sae-byeok wants it this Saturday
at Songi Spicy Chicken Feet.

38:59.253 --> 39:02.047
Chef Park and Mr. Eun are free that day.

39:03.507 --> 39:04.508
This Saturday?

39:05.217 --> 39:06.844
I do have plans.

39:06.927 --> 39:08.887
Okay, we'll do it another day, then.

39:09.429 --> 39:12.641
No, it's hard to find a day
that works for everyone.

39:12.891 --> 39:15.102
I'll just join you guys a bit late.

39:15.185 --> 39:17.104
- Okay, Saturday it is, then.
- Okay.

39:17.980 --> 39:20.315
How come you're not going on a date?
It's Saturday.

39:21.984 --> 39:24.027
Yeah, that's over.

39:25.070 --> 39:27.406
I need a drink. I need this party.

39:29.199 --> 39:30.617
I'm going to drink tons.

39:32.953 --> 39:35.330
How can I just choose one?

39:35.455 --> 39:36.790
One is my teacher for life

39:36.874 --> 39:39.167
and the other is my role model.

39:39.251 --> 39:40.961
I can't choose one. No way.

39:41.044 --> 39:42.421
Please, you two go ahead.

39:42.921 --> 39:44.423
- Good work.
- Thank you.

39:44.506 --> 39:45.841
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

39:46.592 --> 39:47.843
Come here.

39:48.343 --> 39:50.220
How did it go? Tell me.

39:54.641 --> 39:55.642
Mr. Shin.

39:55.851 --> 39:57.728
- This way, please.
- Okay.

40:02.691 --> 40:04.401
- Hello.
- Hello.

40:04.484 --> 40:05.903
- Hello.
- Hello.

40:07.112 --> 40:08.989
- He's Mr. Shin Ji-su.
- Okay.

40:12.117 --> 40:13.493
Mr. Shin Ji-su?

40:13.577 --> 40:14.870
Yes, I'm Shin Ji-su.

40:14.953 --> 40:18.123
The directing team went
to see your play together

40:18.665 --> 40:21.001
and left our business card
because they liked your vibe.

40:21.168 --> 40:23.587
I thought you weren't interested
because you didn't call.

40:25.547 --> 40:27.299
I'm glad to hear you enjoyed my acting.

40:27.674 --> 40:30.218
I recently left the troupe
due to personal reasons.

40:31.094 --> 40:32.888
I'm working hard to do whatever I can.

40:34.389 --> 40:35.807
Do you like to exercise?

40:36.475 --> 40:39.728
Yeah, I lift weights to stay in shape.

40:39.811 --> 40:40.979
- You lift?
- Yes.

40:41.229 --> 40:43.190
Shin Ji-su? That's the guy.

40:43.523 --> 40:45.651
Son Jeong-a's stepson.
He was the talk of the town.

40:45.734 --> 40:47.194
Oh! Yeah, I think that's him.

40:49.196 --> 40:50.864
Okay, then.

40:51.949 --> 40:52.950
This car.

40:54.952 --> 40:58.330
It's a 2017 model,
and it's been driven about 40,000km.

40:58.413 --> 40:59.665
No accidents, of course.

41:00.374 --> 41:01.833
It's in perfect condition outside.

41:02.459 --> 41:05.087
This is perfect for your budget.

41:05.545 --> 41:07.214
You can go inside. Here, this way.

41:07.965 --> 41:08.966
Okay.

41:10.008 --> 41:12.386
A non-smoking lady drove it,
so there's no stench.

41:13.971 --> 41:15.013
Take your time.

42:04.855 --> 42:06.690
SEASONS OF US

42:08.608 --> 42:10.068
Don't just think about it alone.

42:10.152 --> 42:11.903
You'll have moments where you become sure

42:12.404 --> 42:14.114
when you spend more time together.

42:18.243 --> 42:20.537
Ui-yeong, come out when you're ready.

42:21.371 --> 42:22.372
"Come out"?

42:26.668 --> 42:27.669
Ui-yeong!

42:28.628 --> 42:29.629
Hey.

42:32.007 --> 42:33.633
We could've met at the restaurant.

42:38.889 --> 42:39.973
What's with the car?

42:40.432 --> 42:42.225
- It's mine.
- Huh?

42:42.476 --> 42:45.145
I needed one to keep my things
while driving to sets.

42:45.979 --> 42:47.314
What about your motorcycle?

42:47.731 --> 42:49.566
Just hop in. Let's go somewhere nice.

42:50.233 --> 42:51.234
Watch your head.

43:04.664 --> 43:05.957
You're my first passenger.

43:06.875 --> 43:07.918
Be honored.

43:08.376 --> 43:09.920
Sure, what an honor.

43:12.047 --> 43:14.716
Are we going to a restaurant far away?

43:14.800 --> 43:16.760
- Why?
- I need to go

43:16.843 --> 43:19.221
to my intern's farewell party for dinner.

43:19.930 --> 43:23.391
I told them I'd join them later,
thinking we were eating near here.

43:24.059 --> 43:25.268
It's still early in the day.

43:25.352 --> 43:27.562
We can have lunch, get some coffee

43:27.646 --> 43:29.189
and still be back by 7 or 8 p.m.

43:29.314 --> 43:31.441
Oh, that's good enough.

43:31.525 --> 43:32.567
Yeah.

43:36.279 --> 43:41.368
Maybe I'm too used to seeing you
looking for coffee like a zombie.

43:42.744 --> 43:43.870
You look pretty today.

43:45.872 --> 43:46.873
That's random.

43:48.875 --> 43:51.753
Of course, I look better today
than when I go to work.

43:52.129 --> 43:53.713
I should've dressed better, too.

43:54.131 --> 43:56.633
I didn't want to dress up
and get so awkward, though.

44:15.902 --> 44:18.238
- Yeah.
- Hey, Tae-seop.

44:18.405 --> 44:21.032
What time did you leave work?
Did you work until late?

44:21.116 --> 44:22.993
Yeah, I had to help the guys
with some stuff

44:23.076 --> 44:25.537
and brainstorm some ideas
for the exhibition.

44:25.620 --> 44:29.666
You think we can submit to the magazine
the entries we've presented at fairs?

44:29.749 --> 44:31.126
It'll be good to have new works.

44:31.209 --> 44:32.502
Maybe add one new thing.

44:34.254 --> 44:36.464
By the way, did you choose
where we're meeting today?

44:36.548 --> 44:37.799
No, Sae-byeok did.

44:37.883 --> 44:40.552
Dress nice, okay?

44:41.094 --> 44:43.638
Seeing her bosses well-dressed
will make her feel prouder.

44:43.722 --> 44:46.766
Ridiculous. Do I really have to go?

44:46.850 --> 44:50.187
Of course! How can a CEO not come
to the welcome party?

44:50.270 --> 44:52.189
Even I'm taking Sua!

44:52.898 --> 44:55.233
- Fine, see you.
- Bye.

45:05.702 --> 45:06.786
Try this, too.

45:08.622 --> 45:10.540
Stop feeding me.
You should have some, too.

45:10.624 --> 45:12.751
Seeing you eat well makes me full.

45:12.834 --> 45:14.002
That's a lie.

45:14.127 --> 45:15.962
You're going to have ramyeon
at home later.

45:16.296 --> 45:17.964
Wait, that's a great idea.

45:18.298 --> 45:20.926
Ramyeon is the best dessert
after a meaty meal.

45:21.718 --> 45:23.678
That's true. I prefer jjajang ramyeon.

45:23.762 --> 45:25.680
With a sunny-side-up on top.

45:25.764 --> 45:26.890
Okay, sunny-side-up.

45:28.600 --> 45:30.101
- Excuse me.
- Yes?

45:31.228 --> 45:33.271
This table is wobbly.

45:33.688 --> 45:35.815
Sorry, I'll take you to a new table.

45:35.899 --> 45:36.942
- Okay.
- Thank you.

45:43.365 --> 45:44.407
- All good.
- All good.

45:51.581 --> 45:52.582
Something wrong?

45:53.124 --> 45:56.044
Huh? Oh, nothing.
Let's get back to eating.

45:59.881 --> 46:01.258
I haven't been here in forever.

46:01.341 --> 46:03.510
SONGI SPICY CHICKEN FEET

46:03.593 --> 46:04.928
Oh, hello!

46:05.011 --> 46:06.388
You could've just waited inside!

46:07.931 --> 46:09.140
Hi, Sua.

46:09.599 --> 46:10.892
Congrats on getting hired.

46:11.226 --> 46:13.061
I look forward to seeing you grow.

46:13.144 --> 46:14.145
Oh, thanks.

46:15.772 --> 46:18.817
Sua, I'm worried about your growth.

46:18.900 --> 46:21.403
How did you end up choosing this place?

46:21.486 --> 46:22.779
Oh, my supervisors...

46:23.655 --> 46:26.658
I mean, my ex-supervisors at the hotel
love this place.

46:26.741 --> 46:29.661
- What?
- Can you not eat chicken feet?

46:29.744 --> 46:30.829
Oh, that's not it.

46:30.912 --> 46:32.163
I suggested a joint party.

46:32.914 --> 46:35.292
The hotel staff wanted to hold
a farewell party for her.

46:35.375 --> 46:37.794
We know them, anyway.
It'll be nice to see everyone.

46:37.877 --> 46:39.587
I never asked you to do this.

46:39.671 --> 46:41.089
Ui-yeong's coming, too, right?

46:41.172 --> 46:43.383
Yeah, she'll just be a bit late.
She's busy today.

46:43.842 --> 46:45.093
Is that so?

46:45.635 --> 46:49.264
She'll be a bit late, but she's coming!
Let's head in.

46:49.931 --> 46:52.183
I'll call Ui-yeong first and head in.

46:52.267 --> 46:53.268
Okay.

46:53.351 --> 46:55.812
- Grandma!
- Sua!

46:55.895 --> 46:58.523
There's my Sua!

46:58.606 --> 47:02.152
My sweet girl!
You look more and more like your dad.

47:02.986 --> 47:04.821
We have a big party coming today.

47:05.196 --> 47:06.531
We're having a staff party

47:06.614 --> 47:08.783
because we just hired
the intern from the hotel.

47:08.867 --> 47:10.827
- I see.
- Could you watch Sua?

47:10.910 --> 47:12.620
Don't worry, I got her.

47:13.163 --> 47:15.457
Let's have a blast!

47:16.041 --> 47:17.042
Yes!

47:17.125 --> 47:19.961
Does that mean that lady is coming, too?

47:20.545 --> 47:21.880
Oh, yeah.

47:25.091 --> 47:27.677
- My gosh!
- Hello!

47:28.136 --> 47:30.055
- Finally!
- What's going on?

47:30.138 --> 47:31.806
Please use words!

47:31.890 --> 47:33.725
- Did you dine and dash?
- No.

47:33.808 --> 47:34.809
I'll pay for him.

47:34.893 --> 47:36.478
Yeah, he's never paid us.

47:41.816 --> 47:44.694
It's a big party today!

47:46.529 --> 47:48.573
- You're the best!
- Be careful.

47:48.656 --> 47:49.908
Here you go. Be careful.

47:49.991 --> 47:52.535
You're his mother?
I thought you were his sister!

47:53.745 --> 47:56.623
It's on us today! Eat up!

47:57.749 --> 47:59.626
What? I brought the hotel's company card.

47:59.709 --> 48:03.213
No, I'll only charge you
for the drinks on the table now.

48:03.296 --> 48:05.423
Grab any drink from the fridge for free!

48:05.507 --> 48:07.467
- Thank you!
- Thank you!

48:07.550 --> 48:08.927
Thank you so much, miss!

48:09.594 --> 48:11.721
You have to pace yourself, okay?

48:11.805 --> 48:14.432
Ui-yeong isn't here yet,
so just drink water for now.

48:15.225 --> 48:16.559
- Oh, thanks.
- Pace yourself.

48:16.643 --> 48:17.852
This is really good.

48:17.936 --> 48:19.938
Mr. Eun, say something.

48:20.021 --> 48:21.022
Huh?

48:24.192 --> 48:25.235
Oh, gosh.

48:26.361 --> 48:29.322
The sun might still be up as it's summer

48:29.406 --> 48:32.117
but our night has begun!

48:33.201 --> 48:36.621
It's my 40th year of working

48:37.330 --> 48:40.500
and this is the smoothest job transfer
I've seen.

48:40.583 --> 48:42.836
We can send her off with a big smile

48:42.919 --> 48:45.505
because we know how sincere she was
about the work she did.

48:46.131 --> 48:47.173
Goodbye.

48:47.632 --> 48:49.217
Please be kind to our Sae-byeok.

48:49.342 --> 48:50.510
- Okay.
- Yes, sir!

48:50.593 --> 48:53.680
Sae-byeok, you'd better live
the best life of all!

48:53.763 --> 48:56.141
- Goodbye!
- Welcome, Sae-byeok!

48:56.224 --> 48:58.351
- Welcome!
- Welcome!

49:00.562 --> 49:02.772
- Drink up!
- Right on!

49:04.274 --> 49:05.275
Here we go!

49:06.067 --> 49:08.194
Ride the wave!

49:08.278 --> 49:09.446
Right on!

49:10.572 --> 49:12.323
I guess I'm not walking home tonight.

49:34.262 --> 49:35.263
Here.

49:35.680 --> 49:37.724
Oh, thanks.

49:45.106 --> 49:48.026
Oh, how did that audition go?

49:50.069 --> 49:51.863
Awkward. It was my first time, after all.

49:53.615 --> 49:56.701
They told me to remove my tattoos
if I was serious about acting.

49:57.327 --> 49:58.828
Covering them costs extra.

49:59.954 --> 50:00.955
Your tattoos, too?

50:03.041 --> 50:05.043
Are you sure you're okay with this?

50:06.794 --> 50:07.795
What do you mean?

50:07.879 --> 50:10.798
It feels like you're pushing yourself
too hard.

50:11.049 --> 50:13.134
With the tattoo removal and the auditions.

50:13.218 --> 50:14.844
And the car, too.

50:16.095 --> 50:18.014
There's no rush, is there?

50:20.433 --> 50:21.434
I'm fine.

50:21.935 --> 50:23.353
No need to worry about it.

50:23.978 --> 50:26.439
I may not do much,
but I do well when I put my mind to it.

50:27.815 --> 50:30.735
I'm sure the audition went well, too.

50:32.070 --> 50:35.156
You're right. I'm sure you did well.

50:44.916 --> 50:46.167
Sae-byeok.

50:47.418 --> 50:48.920
What's taking Ui-yeong so long?

50:50.088 --> 50:52.590
Is she not here yet?

50:52.674 --> 50:55.635
I asked you first.

50:55.718 --> 50:56.719
Mr. Eun!

50:57.637 --> 50:59.847
Let me call Eui-yeong

51:00.640 --> 51:01.849
right now.

51:01.933 --> 51:03.810
Tell her to hurry
before the drinks get warm!

51:03.893 --> 51:05.895
- Alright! Cheers!
- The HOME style.

51:06.062 --> 51:07.772
The HOME style?

51:52.358 --> 51:53.401
What about today?

51:54.777 --> 51:55.903
How did I do today?

51:57.363 --> 51:58.448
Did I do well?

52:03.411 --> 52:04.412
Ui-yeong.

52:05.079 --> 52:06.164
Oh, yeah.

52:06.581 --> 52:07.582
Did I...

52:09.208 --> 52:10.335
do well today?

52:11.461 --> 52:12.503
If so

52:13.880 --> 52:14.881
give me a reward.

52:16.716 --> 52:17.759
No.

52:21.804 --> 52:22.930
I'll take it myself.

52:28.227 --> 52:29.270
Sorry.

52:39.405 --> 52:40.531
You were...

52:42.325 --> 52:43.701
perfect in every way.

52:44.494 --> 52:45.495
But...

52:48.039 --> 52:49.123
I keep

52:50.375 --> 52:52.043
thinking about someone else.

52:56.881 --> 52:57.924
Ji-su

53:00.218 --> 53:02.303
- I like Tae-seop.
- Did you...

53:04.347 --> 53:05.932
really feel nothing for me?

53:11.521 --> 53:13.106
But don't hesitate to run to me

53:13.690 --> 53:15.108
once your mind's made up.

53:17.360 --> 53:18.945
I don't want to make Tae-seop

53:20.029 --> 53:22.699
wait any longer.

54:10.163 --> 54:11.414
What's your ETA?

54:11.664 --> 54:13.624
I think Mr. Song's exhausted

54:13.708 --> 54:15.793
but he's still here
because he wants to see you.

54:16.711 --> 54:19.881
SONG TAE-SEOP

54:29.223 --> 54:31.476
I want to play basketball.

54:32.101 --> 54:33.144
Basketball...

54:33.519 --> 54:34.937
- Hyun-min.
- Yeah?

54:35.271 --> 54:37.356
You want to go
for a second round of drinks?

54:37.440 --> 54:39.400
- You down?
- Heck yeah!

54:39.484 --> 54:42.278
- Right on!
- I'll take Hyun-min home.

54:42.361 --> 54:43.654
You can go and keep partying.

54:44.197 --> 54:46.949
Gosh, you're still a kid inside.

54:47.950 --> 54:49.619
Chef, do you also need help going home?

54:49.702 --> 54:51.245
No, I called a cab.

54:52.079 --> 54:53.456
But Ui-yeong's still not here.

54:53.539 --> 54:54.582
Ui-yeong!

54:54.874 --> 54:56.167
- My gosh!
- Oh, man.

54:56.375 --> 54:57.376
You scared us.

54:58.294 --> 54:59.378
We screwed up!

55:00.463 --> 55:01.464
Why?

55:01.631 --> 55:02.840
- Jin-su
- Yeah?

55:02.924 --> 55:04.300
use this card at the afterparty.

55:07.720 --> 55:09.680
- Yes!
- Get ready to head out!

55:09.764 --> 55:11.140
- Okay!
- What?

55:17.313 --> 55:18.981
Ms. Lee!

55:20.066 --> 55:22.026
Tae-seop went home, right?

55:22.109 --> 55:23.152
No idea.

55:24.111 --> 55:26.489
Why didn't the lady come?

55:27.281 --> 55:31.035
Sua's asleep now. You can take her home.

55:34.038 --> 55:35.122
Okay, see you.

55:37.166 --> 55:38.793
Fried chicken sounds good.

55:38.876 --> 55:40.920
Yeah, that's better than beef sashimi.

55:41.003 --> 55:42.547
No, you just don't get it.

55:42.630 --> 55:44.006
- We need beef sashimi.
- Yeah.

55:44.090 --> 55:45.591
Fried chicken could be better.

55:45.675 --> 55:47.844
- You just don't know your food.
- Come on.

55:47.927 --> 55:48.970
Sae-byeok!

55:49.053 --> 55:50.054
- Hello.
- Hello.

55:51.222 --> 55:52.723
- Ui-yeong!
- Hey.

55:52.807 --> 55:55.268
I missed you. What took you so long?

55:55.351 --> 55:57.019
Sorry, I'm so late.

55:57.395 --> 55:58.729
Did you drink a lot?

55:59.272 --> 56:00.314
Yeah, we did.

56:00.398 --> 56:01.983
We're having an afterparty. Join us.

56:02.149 --> 56:03.651
Oh, well...

56:03.734 --> 56:05.486
Where's Mr. Song?

56:05.570 --> 56:06.696
Oh, Mr. Song?

56:06.779 --> 56:09.949
He must be at the office.
He's the CEO, so...

56:10.032 --> 56:11.659
No.

56:12.118 --> 56:13.494
He went home.

56:14.328 --> 56:16.330
He went home, not to his office?

56:16.414 --> 56:18.291
Yeah, I'm sure he went home.

56:20.418 --> 56:22.879
Sae-byeok, I'll visit you at HOME soon.

56:22.962 --> 56:23.963
See you then.

56:24.046 --> 56:25.673
- Please take good care of her.
- Okay.

56:25.756 --> 56:26.924
- I'll text you.
- Bye.

56:27.008 --> 56:28.009
Goodnight.

56:34.974 --> 56:35.975
Thank you.

58:01.102 --> 58:02.603
I'll wait for you.

58:02.979 --> 58:05.690
I'm really good at waiting
once I set my mind to it.

58:07.608 --> 58:08.693
No way...

58:16.909 --> 58:20.746
SONGI SPICY CHICKEN FEET

58:39.390 --> 58:40.433
What are you doing?

58:51.777 --> 58:52.778
Ui-yeong.

58:55.614 --> 58:56.657
Yes!

59:01.203 --> 59:03.372
Do you want to go on a date
once the project's over?

59:03.539 --> 59:04.540
A date?

59:05.416 --> 59:07.209
I couldn't stop thinking about you,
so here I am.

59:11.839 --> 59:13.174
I like you.

59:13.674 --> 59:16.093
I'm glad we met now.

59:18.596 --> 59:20.306
But don't hesitate to run to me

59:21.932 --> 59:23.350
once your mind's made up.

01:00:21.408 --> 01:00:22.660
Is this a dream?

01:00:26.497 --> 01:00:29.375
No, it's not.

01:00:33.462 --> 01:00:34.505
You're here.

01:00:37.133 --> 01:00:38.592
Were you here the whole time?

01:00:39.510 --> 01:00:41.178
I couldn't even reach you on the phone.

01:00:42.930 --> 01:00:44.890
I know it's warm

01:00:45.891 --> 01:00:47.643
but you can't sleep out here.

01:00:48.227 --> 01:00:51.647
I took a nap in my car,
but everyone was gone when I came back.

01:00:52.773 --> 01:00:55.609
I didn't want you to come
and see that everyone was gone.

01:00:56.986 --> 01:00:58.779
And what if I hadn't come?

01:01:00.072 --> 01:01:01.490
But you said you'd come.

01:01:02.199 --> 01:01:04.285
That was why I waited.

01:01:07.705 --> 01:01:10.749
Do you realize...

01:01:12.334 --> 01:01:15.421
how heavy of a promise it is
to wait for someone?

01:01:23.220 --> 01:01:24.430
Give me a sec.

01:01:33.731 --> 01:01:34.732
Huh?

01:01:37.943 --> 01:01:39.403
You should just have some water.

01:01:44.909 --> 01:01:46.202
You want me to drink with you?

01:01:48.204 --> 01:01:49.246
No.

01:01:51.332 --> 01:01:54.168
I just need some courage.

01:01:54.919 --> 01:01:57.254
And you can't forget

01:01:58.672 --> 01:02:01.592
what I'm about to say right now.

01:02:15.981 --> 01:02:16.982
I...

01:02:18.692 --> 01:02:20.444
didn't come here for the party.

01:02:23.530 --> 01:02:26.867
Remember how you told me

01:02:29.828 --> 01:02:32.081
to run to you

01:02:33.374 --> 01:02:36.460
as soon as my mind was made up?

01:02:38.629 --> 01:02:39.797
That was why I came here.

01:02:42.258 --> 01:02:44.969
To tell you I've made up my mind.

01:02:52.768 --> 01:02:53.936
I like you.

01:02:57.982 --> 01:02:58.983
I...

01:03:00.943 --> 01:03:02.027
like you

01:03:03.279 --> 01:03:04.321
too.

01:03:09.118 --> 01:03:10.411
I wanted to see you

01:03:12.621 --> 01:03:13.831
and I couldn't hold it back

01:03:15.749 --> 01:03:17.042
so here I am.

01:03:29.555 --> 01:03:30.681
Thanks for coming.

01:03:36.979 --> 01:03:37.980
Promise me

01:03:40.190 --> 01:03:41.275
you won't go anywhere.

01:04:31.992 --> 01:04:35.537
THE PRACTICAL GUIDE TO LOVE

01:04:35.829 --> 01:04:40.209
I'LL WAIT FOR YOU

01:04:44.338 --> 01:04:47.841
I'VE NEVER FELT THIS WAY BEFORE

01:04:47.925 --> 01:04:51.428
THE MOMENT YOU BECOME SURE OF YOUR LOVE

01:05:01.563 --> 01:05:04.983
I LIKE YOU

01:05:08.779 --> 01:05:09.780
- Ta-da!
- Hm?

01:05:10.114 --> 01:05:12.199
Congratulations on your new relationship.

01:05:12.616 --> 01:05:14.827
Yeah, anything's possible.

01:05:15.953 --> 01:05:17.454
Boyfriend?

01:05:17.913 --> 01:05:20.541
We can't just assume
people on dating apps are less serious.

01:05:20.624 --> 01:05:22.584
You know how many weirdos go
on blind dates?

01:05:22.668 --> 01:05:24.628
So, how many blind dates have you been on?

01:05:24.711 --> 01:05:25.754
Just a few.

01:05:25.838 --> 01:05:28.966
So, you're the one who got hired
because of Jeong-a.

01:05:29.633 --> 01:05:30.926
- Where are you going?
- No way.

01:05:31.343 --> 01:05:32.469
- A blind date?
- A blind date?

01:05:32.970 --> 01:05:34.096
Let go!

01:05:35.180 --> 01:05:36.265
Tae-seop!

01:05:43.939 --> 01:05:45.941
Subtitles by: Min-sun Kim
